ing Cream or Liquid Bronzer) all over the body.<\/p><p>2. Apply the powder immediately after the base, while the skin is still slightly damp. This ensures better fixation.<\/p><p>3. Control the amount of product depending on the desired effect — from a delicate glow to an intense stage shine.<\/p><p>4. Use a large soft brush with dense hair. It will help distribute the product quickly and evenly without fallout. The perfect choice is the JOSS brush.<\/p><p>5. Leave the products on the skin for 15–20 minutes to let them settle and lock in place.<\/p>","button":"Buy it now","button_url":"shopify:\/\/products\/powder-brush-soft-and-versatile","media_type":"video","video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/IMG_8361.MP4","video_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}}},"block_order":["slide_TpkiYK"],"name":"Powder","settings":{"slide_gap":48,"slide_gap_mobile":32,"media_position":"left","media_position_mobile":"top","media_radius":12,"media_border_thickness":0,"media_ratio":"portrait","media_ratio_mobile":"portrait","content_vertical_align":"center","content_horizontal_align":"start","content_horizontal_align_mobile":"start","heading_custom":false,"heading_font":"josefin_sans_n4","heading_size":44,"heading_size_mobile":24,"heading_height":110,"heading_mt_mobile":24,"text_custom":false,"text_font":"josefin_sans_n4","text_size":18,"text_size_mobile":18,"text_height":170,"text_mt":32,"button_custom":false,"button_font":"josefin_sans_n4","button_size":16,"button_size_mobile":16,"button_height":100,"button_mt":32,"button_padding_vertical":16,"button_padding_vertical_mobile":16,"button_padding_horizontal":38,"button_padding_horizontal_mobile":38,"button_radius":12,"button_border_thickness":1,"button_style":"outline","arrow_size":72,"arrow_size_mobile":48,"arrow_icon_size":36,"arrow_icon_size_mobile":28,"arrow_border_thickness":0,"arrow_show_desktop":false,"arrow_show_mobile":false,"heading_color":"#d09b4a","text_color":"#ffffff","button_color":"#412e27","button_hover_color":"#d09b4a","button_bg_color":"#d09b4a","button_bg_hover_color":"#000000","button_border_color":"#d09b4a","button_border_hover_color":"#d09b4a","arrow_color":"#ffffff","arrow_hover_color":"#ffffff","arrow_bg_color":"#000000","arrow_bg_hover_color":"#d8d8d8","arrow_border_color":"#ffffff","arrow_border_hover_color":"#ffffff","media_border_color":"#000000","background_color":"#000000","background_gradient":"","border_color":"#000000","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"margin_horizontal":0,"margin_horizontal_mobile":0,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"padding_horizontal":5,"padding_horizontal_mobile":1.5,"full_width":true,"content_width":120,"border_thickness":0,"section_radius":0,"lazy":true}},"ss_video_with_text_5_RMpR88":{"type":"ss-video-with-text-5","blocks":{"slide_LCiRBK":{"type":"slide","settings":{"heading":"<p>Perfect Removal Routine<\/p>","text":"<p>To gently and effectively remove your tanning products while keeping your skin smooth and healthy, follow these steps:<\/p><ol><li><strong>Begin with warm water<\/strong> — allow the skin to soften and the product to loosen naturally.<\/li><li><strong>Cleanse delicately<\/strong> — use a mild shower gel or soap, avoiding harsh scrubbing to protect your skin.<\/li><li><strong>Use a soft sponge or cloth<\/strong> — massage in gentle circular motions for an even and effortless removal.<\/li><li><strong>Repeat if needed<\/strong> — deeper tones or layered applications may require a second cleanse.<\/li><li><strong>Hydrate your skin<\/strong> — finish with a nourishing lotion or oil to restore softness and glow.<\/li><\/ol>","button":"","button_url":"shopify:\/\/products\/powder-brush-soft-and-versatile","media_type":"video","video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/IMG_5231.MOV","video_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}}},"block_order":["slide_LCiRBK"],"name":"Powder","settings":{"slide_gap":48,"slide_gap_mobile":32,"media_position":"left","media_position_mobile":"top","media_radius":12,"media_bo